TEXT -608 -128 Left 3 ;In this example the three phase system is shorted\nSince the coupling between shield and conductor\nis assumed ONE the shield current is the same like\nthe conductor current and so the line impedances\nare compensated to zero values. So only the inner\ninductance remains which is modelled externally.
